Copyright 2026 Lasimeri

Builds on XKS_Jev-like_Model_Base (https://github.com/Lasimeri/XKS_Jev-like_Model_Base,
MIT or Apache-2.0), used client side only: its System One wire types and the
HTTP client of a running `jevbase serve`.

The calibration set (calibration/) labels files of Intel-Phi-Jev,
Mechanical-Jev, XKS_Jev-like_Model_Base, XKS-Memory, xks-id and x1tt3r by the
role of the folder they live in; the files themselves are read from local
checkouts and are not part of this repository.

